    "updated_at": "2018-01-23T01:35:15Z",
    "body": "I don't have much further insight, but I can report that I've seen supernova go down sometimes when creating, destroying or moving groups.\r\n\r\nI recall reading in Tim's thesis on supernova that it keeps a dependency graph, for syncing of non-parallel groups. (Scsynth doesn't need a dependency graph because processing of synth nodes is synchronous.) Creating, destroying or moving groups changes this graph. The issue is probably here.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
