    "body": "> It seems that runnable_items would be empty if there are not running nodes for example (which is not the case as we dont get nova::dsp_queue_interpreter::run_item: possible lookup detected in dsp helper thread advise in this case)\r\n\r\nI usually get few of these `nova::dsp_queue_interpreter::run_item: possible lookup detected in dsp helper thread` posted before it exits:\r\n```\r\nnova::dsp_queue_interpreter::run_item: possible lookup detected in dsp helper thread\r\nnova::dsp_queue_interpreter::run_item: possible lookup detected in dsp helper thread\r\nnova::dsp_queue_interpreter::run_item: possible lookup detected in main audio thread\r\nServer 'localhost' exited with exit code 255.\r\n```",
